    "name_raw": "Slaying Sprint",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Rival Guide pg. 11",
    "definition_raw": "Source Rival Guide pg. 11\nWith swift feet and deadly intent, you finish off your target before anyone sees your blade.\n\nPrerequisites: Dodge, Mobility, Spring Attack, base attack bonus +13.\n\nBenefit: You can move up to half your speed instead of taking a 5-foot step when taking a full-round action to perform a coup de grace. Performing a coup de grace does not provoke attacks of opportunity.\n\nYou can use this feat only when wielding a light or onehanded weapon.",
